# at.yaml -- the anytime detector's config TEMPLATE.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (a defect found while building Task 3's adapter): the campaign
# patches five factor levels into `at.yaml` --
#
#     /anytime/wrapped   /anytime/bound   /anytime/alpha
#     /anytime/dispersion_window_us       /anytime/indeterminate_policy
#
# -- and a `config_patch` NEVER CREATES STRUCTURE. An absent pointer aborts every row of
# that factor's levels (LAUNCH-CHECKLIST item 5; it aborted every row of a level in a
# prior epoch). `at.yaml` was referenced by run_command and by all five `apply` blocks
# but existed nowhere in the tree and no task created it, so every row would have
# aborted at row 1. This template declares all five pointers so each patch has
# something to address.
#
# It also declares `threshold:` -- the per-row FPR calibration knob the adapter rewrites
# in a COPY. write_cfg() PRESERVES every other line, because regenerating the block from
# scratch would silently discard the factor levels and measure the baseline corner on
# every row (the single worst failure mode available to the adapter).
#
# The VALUES here are placeholders. Every one is overwritten -- the five pointers by
# nousko's config_patch, `threshold` by the adapter's calibration. They are chosen to be
# valid, never to be meaningful.
#
# It is a TEMPLATE (.template) under campaign/apparatus/ rather than a live `at.yaml` at
# the repo root because the repo root is not a campaign-owned directory and because a
# live at.yaml would be mutated in place by the patch. `nous run` is invoked from the
# repo root, so copy it into place as part of the launch gate:
#
#     cp campaign/apparatus/at.yaml.template at.yaml
#
# NOTE FOR THE BUILD STAGE: `anytime:` is not yet a block sim/saturation/config.go
# knows. LoadSaturationConfig parses with KnownFields(true), so this file is a HARD
# PARSE ERROR until config.go gains the block, its resolver, its registry case and its
# blockOwners() row. That is the build stage's work; the five keys below are the surface
# the campaign's factors have already committed to.
anytime:
  wrapped: composite
  bound: howard_eb
  alpha: 0.05
  dispersion_window_us: 2000000
  indeterminate_policy: strict
  threshold: 1.0
